WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.443
Vinnie's back felt stiff.

2
00:00:10.444 --> 00:00:15.199
He stretched and followed the other cleaners out of the theater.

3
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:19.073
"Good night, Vinnie!" Mikhail called out.

4
00:00:19.074 --> 00:00:22.016
"Wait!" Vinnie cried.

5
00:00:22.017 --> 00:00:26.318
"Uh, I'm looking for a place to stay tonight.

6
00:00:26.319 --> 00:00:29.187
I have nowhere to sleep."

7
00:00:29.188 --> 00:00:32.086
Mikhail looked at him kindly.

8
00:00:32.087 --> 00:00:34.835
"Let me ask Papa."

9
00:00:34.836 --> 00:00:39.304
He spoke to a man smoking a pipe nearby.

10
00:00:39.305 --> 00:00:45.585
"We live simply, Vinnie," Mikhail's father said, "but you are welcome.

11
00:00:45.586 --> 00:00:49.007
The czar does not care about his people.

12
00:00:49.008 --> 00:00:52.192
So we must take care of one another."

13
00:00:52.193 --> 00:00:56.184
"Thank you," Vinnie said with relief.

14
00:00:56.185 --> 00:00:59.795
He hoped Mandy had a place to sleep too.

15
00:00:59.796 --> 00:01:03.568
Mikhail's home was very small, but clean.

16
00:01:03.569 --> 00:01:09.331
It was three rooms in an apartment building near the marketplace.

17
00:01:09.332 --> 00:01:13.805
Mikhail's mother welcomed them with soup and some bread.

18
00:01:13.806 --> 00:01:23.054
"This isn't much," Mikhail's mother said, handing Vinnie a thin blanket, "but it will keep you warm."

19
00:01:23.055 --> 00:01:27.303
Vinnie soon fell asleep next to Mikhail.

20
00:01:27.304 --> 00:01:32.991
The next day, they ate hot cereal called kasha for breakfast.

21
00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:38.754
Afterward, Mikhail's mother poured tea into three glasses and one cup.

22
00:01:38.755 --> 00:01:42.246
"Have some tea," she said.

23
00:01:42.247 --> 00:01:47.083
Vinnie reached for the cup, but Mikhail's mother stopped him.

24
00:01:47.084 --> 00:01:52.748
"Drinking tea from cups is only for women," she laughed.

25
00:01:52.749 --> 00:01:56.998
"Russian men drink from glasses."

26
00:01:56.999 --> 00:02:01.327
"Today is a big day!" said Mikhail's father.

27
00:02:01.328 --> 00:02:05.656
"We're going into the Imperial Palace of the czar."

28
00:02:05.657 --> 00:02:09.259
"Why are you going there?" Vinnie asked.

29
00:02:09.260 --> 00:02:14.079
"We have a special delivery to make," Mikhail replied.

30
00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:17.903
"Today is the presentation of the Easter gift.

31
00:02:17.904 --> 00:02:22.781
Papa and Uncle Anton are in charge of the flowers."

32
00:02:22.782 --> 00:02:26.035
"What gift?" asked Vinnie.

33
00:02:26.036 --> 00:02:34.642
Mikhail chuckled, "Why, the same gift that is given to the royal family every Easter!"

34
00:02:34.643 --> 00:02:40.451
Vinnie had no idea what the gift was, but he pretended to know:

35
00:02:40.452 --> 00:02:43.892
"Oh, that is exciting.

36
00:02:43.893 --> 00:02:46.870
I can't wait to see it."

37
00:02:46.871 --> 00:02:51.036
"I'll need help," said Mikhail's father.

38
00:02:51.037 --> 00:02:55.590
"Anton and I can't carry all the baskets of flowers."

39
00:02:55.591 --> 00:02:59.269
Mikhail and Vinnie were eager to help.

40
00:02:59.270 --> 00:03:03.399
They wanted to see inside the palace too.

41
00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:10.984
Meanwhile, Mandy had slept in a small servant's room in Anna Pavlova's house.

42
00:03:10.985 --> 00:03:16.344
First thing in the morning, Mandy had to take Anna her breakfast.

43
00:03:16.345 --> 00:03:20.110
Then Mandy helped the ballerina dress.

44
00:03:20.111 --> 00:03:24.756
"I'm going to have lunch at the palace," she told Mandy.

45
00:03:24.757 --> 00:03:27.267
"You will come with me.

46
00:03:27.268 --> 00:03:32.090
Make sure the ruffle at the bottom of my dress stays clean."

47
00:03:32.091 --> 00:03:36.147
Anna pointed to the hem of her long dress.

48
00:03:36.148 --> 00:03:41.946
When Mandy and Anna arrived at the palace, Mandy was speechless.

49
00:03:41.947 --> 00:03:45.371
It wasn't just the size of the palace.

50
00:03:45.372 --> 00:03:48.740
It was how luxurious it was!

51
00:03:48.741 --> 00:03:53.013
The palace reminded her of Versailles in France.

52
00:03:53.014 --> 00:03:57.162
Four palace guards came out to meet the carriage.

53
00:03:57.163 --> 00:04:00.177
Anna gracefully got out.

54
00:04:00.178 --> 00:04:05.195
Mandy was close behind, but she wasn't so graceful.

55
00:04:05.196 --> 00:04:14.115
Mandy tripped on the hem of the ballerina's dress.
